---
// The timeline was /itinerary-timeline while it was a test page; it's the itinerary itself now
// (/itinerary), and the list is /itinerary-list. Old links and bookmarks land on the timeline
// with their query (?trip=, ?now=, ?day=) kept. A temporary redirect (302), so a browser
// doesn't remember it for good.
return Astro.redirect(`/itinerary${Astro.url.search}`, 302)
---
